address={Univ Florida, Coll Design Construct & Planning, Dept Landscape Architecture, Gainesville, FL 32601 USA and Biodivers Conservat Ctr, Natl Trust Nat Conservat, Chitwan, Nepal and San Diego State Univ, Dept Geog, San Diego, CA 92182 USA and San Diego State Univ, Dept Biol, San Diego, CA 92182 USA and Univ Texas, Dept Geog Informat Sci, Dallas, TX USA and Auburn Univ, Coll Forestry, Complex Human Environm Syst Lab, Wildlife & Environm, Auburn, AL 36849 USA},
